{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"kakra-and-the-little-fish","version":1,"title":"Kakra and the Little Fish","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Early in the morning, Kakra stood on the beach with his mother. The sky was pink. The sea was calm. ‘Here comes Grandfather!’ he said.","sentences":["Early in the morning, Kakra stood on the beach with his mother.","The sky was pink.","The sea was calm.","‘Here comes Grandfather!’ he said."],"alt":"A boy and his mother wait on the beach as a canoe comes in at sunrise.","image":{"hash":"sha256:5bd2cc6d2790f4bd254d5c7d0b173957cceef9bf0ae90defcf9d346191d042f6","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:510babe8d50b8807c4eaf9fa97ddc8c7f877cb47744655dda98b7beb37aa586a","durationMs":14800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6781],[6781,8786],[8786,10791],[10791,14800]],"words":[[0,619],[619,866],[866,1237],[1237,2302],[2302,2920],[2920,3539],[3539,3787],[3787,4158],[4158,4777],[4777,5272],[5272,5643],[5643,6781],[6781,7153],[7153,7524],[7524,7895],[7895,8786],[8786,9157],[9157,9528],[9528,9900],[9900,10791],[10791,11286],[11286,11904],[11904,13662],[13662,13909],[13909,14800]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"The canoe slid up onto the sand. Grandfather wore his life jacket. He always did. He lifted the net out of the canoe.","sentences":["The canoe slid up onto the sand.","Grandfather wore his life jacket.","He always did.","He lifted the net out of the canoe."],"alt":"A fisherman in a life jacket lifts a net out of a canoe on the sand.","image":{"hash":"sha256:bb82efe2026dc2eb99d0c3f34f3a2950c7d3a65fbb53abdc150e0ff704bfb4f0","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:ac8fbfad30fe2fcd962851b39b7a82a2f32f8de80b0ebda5c9515136c82c7eb9","durationMs":13880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3771],[3771,7943],[7943,9842],[9842,13880]],"words":[[0,401],[401,1070],[1070,1605],[1605,1872],[1872,2407],[2407,2808],[2808,3771],[3771,5242],[5242,5777],[5777,6178],[6178,6713],[6713,7943],[7943,8210],[8210,9013],[9013,9842],[9842,10109],[10109,10911],[10911,11313],[11313,11714],[11714,12115],[12115,12382],[12382,12784],[12784,13880]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"The net was full of fish! Kakra counted the big ones. ‘One, two, three, four, five, six!’ Mama put them in her big basin.","sentences":["The net was full of fish!","Kakra counted the big ones.","‘One, two, three, four, five, six!’ Mama put them in her big basin."],"alt":"A boy counts big fish while his mother puts them in a basin.","image":{"hash":"sha256:dd17213cb094a3b29daa465c21fb818a03351936a8b4fd8f197b95afbca31528","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:473c65dbd7571a71f83f49887417f6ccc133fb50f64e55d6073d01c2109456dc","durationMs":17080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3517],[3517,7510],[7510,17080]],"words":[[0,475],[475,951],[951,1426],[1426,2060],[2060,2377],[2377,3517],[3517,4310],[4310,5419],[5419,5894],[5894,6369],[6369,7510],[7510,8239],[8239,8968],[8968,10014],[10014,10901],[10901,11788],[11788,12770],[12770,13404],[13404,13879],[13879,14513],[14513,14830],[14830,15305],[15305,15781],[15781,17080]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Then Kakra saw some tiny fish, as small as his finger. ‘Grandfather, why not take these too?’ he asked.","sentences":["Then Kakra saw some tiny fish, as small as his finger.","‘Grandfather, why not take these too?’ he asked."],"alt":"A boy points at a few tiny fish in the net.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d6072cbcfc98fe07421c91fbd772d594b511718fa93593395de55f6a09cfe76c","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:8c0ea846e20816e7b144e2ef6d8fdce9f6b4eecb52332fb9217a86adba09b71f","durationMs":12080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6226],[6226,12080]],"words":[[0,532],[532,1197],[1197,1596],[1596,2129],[2129,2661],[2661,3406],[3406,3672],[3672,4337],[4337,4603],[4603,5002],[5002,6226],[6226,7903],[7903,8302],[8302,8701],[8701,9233],[9233,9898],[9898,10723],[10723,10989],[10989,12080]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Grandfather gently picked up the little fish. He walked to the water and put them back in. Splash! They swam away.","sentences":["Grandfather gently picked up the little fish.","He walked to the water and put them back in.","Splash!","They swam away."],"alt":"A fisherman gently puts small fish back into the sea.","image":{"hash":"sha256:92467ebf075035d8a3fa050cb757281260d64c51c7b70f3f76396eccab88e99b","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:68f602843532ac0b8b70458ca1d9a2b93939b721bf52413bb8fd48785b543d99","durationMs":12360,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4954],[4954,9426],[9426,10532],[10532,12360]],"words":[[0,1323],[1323,2044],[2044,2765],[2765,3006],[3006,3367],[3367,4088],[4088,4954],[4954,5194],[5194,5915],[5915,6156],[6156,6517],[6517,7118],[7118,7479],[7479,7839],[7839,8320],[8320,8801],[8801,9426],[9426,10532],[10532,11013],[11013,11494],[11494,12360]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"‘Little fish need time to grow big,’ said Grandfather. ‘When they are big, they have babies. If we take all the little ones, one day there will be no fish for you to catch.’","sentences":["‘Little fish need time to grow big,’ said Grandfather.","‘When they are big, they have babies.","If we take all the little ones, one day there will be no fish for you to catch.’"],"alt":"A grandfather talks to his grandson at the water’s edge.","image":{"hash":"sha256:3fa91ac7dd901801c08ecf77a57a49e6b899d0525c77d1181c501f4b44a9a8bc","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:dc7d90f6e231b0f0de36f84ca9793b162623b8a1581bf10c25e12a883dcd8d0d","durationMs":15400,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4991],[4991,8489],[8489,15400]],"words":[[0,640],[640,1066],[1066,1493],[1493,1920],[1920,2133],[2133,2560],[2560,3050],[3050,3477],[3477,4991],[4991,5418],[5418,5844],[5844,6164],[6164,6655],[6655,7081],[7081,7508],[7508,8489],[8489,8702],[8702,8916],[8916,9342],[9342,9662],[9662,9982],[9982,10622],[10622,11219],[11219,11539],[11539,11859],[11859,12393],[12393,12819],[12819,13032],[13032,13246],[13246,13672],[13672,13992],[13992,14312],[14312,14525],[14525,15400]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"‘That is why my net has big holes,’ said Grandfather. ‘The small fish can swim out. We keep the big ones.’ Kakra looked at the net and nodded.","sentences":["‘That is why my net has big holes,’ said Grandfather.","‘The small fish can swim out.","We keep the big ones.’ Kakra looked at the net and nodded."],"alt":"A boy looks at the big holes in a net while small fish swim away.","image":{"hash":"sha256:1fb45091973b2250b0e3d839fdf3e33788ff30eb17deeccf63e26fcfa803a15a","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:66fbe6e8cab9216f2d235ae6b68fcee78395e026e55ed4e45137e01ea6866ae0","durationMs":15760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5864],[5864,9163],[9163,15760]],"words":[[0,524],[524,785],[785,1178],[1178,1440],[1440,1833],[1833,2225],[2225,2618],[2618,3482],[3482,4005],[4005,5864],[5864,6257],[6257,6911],[6911,7435],[7435,7828],[7828,8351],[8351,9163],[9163,9425],[9425,9948],[9948,10341],[10341,10734],[10734,11676],[11676,12330],[12330,13116],[13116,13378],[13378,13770],[13770,14163],[14163,14556],[14556,15760]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Kakra helped Mama carry the basin. ‘I want to be a fisherman like Grandfather,’ he said. ‘I will take only what we need, and leave the little ones.’ The end.","sentences":["Kakra helped Mama carry the basin.","‘I want to be a fisherman like Grandfather,’ he said.","‘I will take only what we need, and leave the little ones.’ The end."],"alt":"A boy and his mother carry a basin of fish along the beach as the sun rises.","image":{"hash":"sha256:a77b98456e0f89f656a5aa2414703c08e836728b0065a7349392f60254333c3e","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:9e625e57c26ada73d71d0dca8ddf